<title>FRANCE: EU grants free-mkt wheat, barley, rye, oats.</title>
<headline>EU grants free-mkt wheat, barley, rye, oats.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday granted the following rebates to export free-market grain to non-EU countries, member country officials said.</p>
<p>			 Tonnage		Maximum rebate</p>
<p> Soft wheat	  477,700		17.47 Ecus/tonne</p>
<p> Durum wheat	  13,400		 6.50 Ecus/tonne</p>
<p> Barley		 76,550		30.50 Ecus/tonne</p>
<p> Rye		     2,000		31.99 Ecus/tonne</p>
<p> Oats		    2,500		33.95 Ecus/tonne</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
